Important commands for your Maven + SonarQube project
Command	             Purpose
mvn clean	           Remove previous build output
mvn compile	         Compile Java source
mvn test	           Execute unit tests
mvn package	         Generate JAR
mvn verify	         Execute verification lifecycle
mvn sonar:sonar	     Run SonarQube analysis using configured plugin
mvn clean verify	    Clean, test and verify



Full analysis command:

mvn clean verify

mvn org.sonarsource.scanner.maven:sonar-maven-plugin:5.5.0.6356:sonar \
-Dsonar.projectKey=maven-java-demo \
-Dsonar.host.url=http://localhost:9000 \
-Dsonar.token="$SONAR_TOKEN" \
-Dsonar.coverage.jacoco.xmlReportPaths=target/site/jacoco/jacoco.xml
